   "text": "**Auxier**, a small community on the Levisa Fork of the Big Sandy River in **Floyd County**, eastern Kentucky, just north of Prestonsburg, the county seat. ✅ (RJ trip blog, Mar 2026; WEKU, Feb 2025). The group flies in, picks up rental cars, and drives about three hours to Auxier. ✅. Work sites are about 40 minutes' drive from where the group stays, so homes may be in neighboring counties. ✅",
