   "h": "The partner",
   "text": "**Hand in Hand Ministries** (Hand in Hand), founded in 1999 by brothers Wayne Fowler and Fr. Joe Fowler, headquartered in Louisville, with an Appalachian center at 21 S. River Street, Auxier. ✅ (myhandinhand.org/about; GuideStar). Its mission is to meet the housing, education and health-care needs of economically vulnerable people. ✅ GuideStar. In Appalachia it serves **Floyd, Johnson, Magoffin and Martin counties**. ✅ (GuideStar; ARH Foundation release, Dec 2024). Immersion volunteers, guided by local contractors, repair **dozens of homes a year** — bathrooms, floors, ceilings, underpinning, kitchen sinks and wheelchair ramps; an emergency food pantry serves nearly 75 families a month; aging in place help keeps older residents in their homes through ramps, food and help reaching medical care. ✅ GuideStar. Organization-wide budget about $2.2 million (year ending Dec 2025). ✅ BBB Give.org, Sept 2026. Hand in Hand also works in Belize, Nicaragua and west Louisville. ✅",
