   "plain": "Many older and disabled people in these counties own their home outright, but the house — often a mobile home or an old frame house — has steps, a porch or a bathroom they can no longer safely use. Fixing it costs cash, skill and labor that a fixed income cannot buy and the local market no longer supplies.",
