   "plain": "In a narrow valley, the flat land is along the creeks and rivers, so that is where the roads and houses are. The floods of 2022 and 2025 showed that most damaged homes had no flood insurance, that the federal flood maps missed much of the real risk, and that disaster aid pays to make a home livable, not to rebuild it.",
