   "plain": "Most people in Floyd County get health coverage through Medicaid or Medicare. Kentucky's 2014 Medicaid expansion cut the uninsured rate sharply and now pays for much of the region's health care, including addiction treatment. That makes families and hospitals both secure and exposed: when the rules in Washington or Frankfort change, the whole county feels it at once.",
