     "text": "**All Social Security plus SSI paid into Floyd County, Dec 2025: about $19.9 million in one month**, roughly $238 million a year *(our arithmetic, ×12)*. Medicaid paid $199.3 million to Floyd County providers in FY2024 (Barrier 5).",
